 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Two bodies approach",
   "text": "A 5 kg body at 10 m s⁻¹ catches a 10 kg body moving the same way at 5 m s⁻¹. Press play and watch the collision at \\( t = 1 \\).",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 5,
      "m2": 10,
      "u1": 10,
      "u2": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "lv": 0,
      "pr": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Elastic collision",
   "text": "They bounce apart. **Elastic:** the bodies do not stick and no kinetic energy is lost.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 5,
      "m2": 10,
      "u1": 10,
      "u2": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "lv": 1,
      "pr": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "pr": 2
     },
     "at": 200,
     "dur": 4200
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "What is conserved?",
   "text": "Momentum is \\( {{pb|0}} \\) before and after. Kinetic energy is also the same (the bars match), and the **relative speed** of approach {{apr|0}} equals that of separation {{sep|0}}. Here \\( v_1 = {{v1f|2}} \\), \\( v_2 = {{v2f|2}} \\) m s⁻¹.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 5,
      "m2": 10,
      "u1": 10,
      "u2": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "lv": 2,
      "pr": 2
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "title": "Perfectly inelastic",
   "text": "Two equal carts, 2 m s⁻¹ and \\( -1 \\) m s⁻¹, **couple together** and move off with one velocity: \\( v = \\dfrac{m_1u_1 + m_2u_2}{m_1 + m_2} = {{vc|1}} \\) m s⁻¹.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 5,
      "m2": 5,
      "u1": 2,
      "u2": -1,
      "mode": 1,
      "lv": 2,
      "pr": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "pr": 2
     },
     "at": 200,
     "dur": 4200
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "title": "Momentum yes, KE no",
   "text": "Momentum is still conserved ({{pb|1}} → {{pa|1}}), but kinetic energy drops from {{KEb|1}} J to {{KEa|2}} J. The lost energy becomes heat, sound and deformation.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 5,
      "m2": 5,
      "u1": 2,
      "u2": -1,
      "mode": 1,
      "lv": 3,
      "pr": 2
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "title": "Light on heavy",
   "text": "Same elastic formulas, new numbers: a 1 kg body at 4 m s⁻¹ hits a 7 kg body at rest. It rebounds with \\( v_1 = {{v1e|1}} \\) and the heavy one moves at \\( v_2 = {{v2e|1}} \\) m s⁻¹. (Same ratio as a 0.5 kg and 3.5 kg pair.)",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 1,
      "m2": 7,
      "u1": 4,
      "u2": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "lv": 3,
      "pr": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "pr": 2
     },
     "at": 200,
     "dur": 4200
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
